{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Blight: Survival",
    "steam_appid": 1774880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/d1e4140abdfd2dc5fd69043060cecc9e.avif?t=1744224268\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blight: Survival is a medieval Action-Horror experience pitting you and up to three other players against mortals and monsters in a desperate attempt to reach and destroy the source of the Blight, a deadly affliction that plagues the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/23558065e99b916262febebc534d735b.poster.avif?t=1744224268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/23558065e99b916262febebc534d735b.webm?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/23558065e99b916262febebc534d735b.mp4?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in the no man\u2019s land between two desperate kingdoms in a ceaseless war. Within this purgatory, a new strain of Blight has erupted from remains of the fallen. Fed and strengthened by the blood that has been spilled, it rapidly spreads - turning man into monster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the people bleed - paralyzed by war - they have turned to you and your kin, the Writhens. Being the only ones willing, you've been tasked to venture forth and eradicate the all-consuming Blight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/931c03d14e439e58645604af7a0e68ff.poster.avif?t=1744224268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/931c03d14e439e58645604af7a0e68ff.webm?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/931c03d14e439e58645604af7a0e68ff.mp4?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a fresh take on Action-Horror games which mixes a deep Visceral combat with mechanics inspired from rogue-lites and extraction games, offering a unique and thrilling gameplay experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight with up to three friends against both humans and monsters in a visceral co-op action experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your decision-making skills to the test. Will you go back and secure your spoils or risk it all and push forward? How far are you willing to go? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an engaging directional combat system that is accessible to newcomers but offers a high skill ceiling for more seasoned players. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a diverse range of weapons, armor, talents and customize them to best suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a beautifully decaying medieval world filled with secrets and hidden treasures waiting to be discovered. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/d1e4140abdfd2dc5fd69043060cecc9e.avif?t=1744224268\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blight: Survival is a medieval Action-Horror experience pitting you and up to three other players against mortals and monsters in a desperate attempt to reach and destroy the source of the Blight, a deadly affliction that plagues the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/23558065e99b916262febebc534d735b.poster.avif?t=1744224268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/23558065e99b916262febebc534d735b.webm?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/23558065e99b916262febebc534d735b.mp4?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in the no man\u2019s land between two desperate kingdoms in a ceaseless war. Within this purgatory, a new strain of Blight has erupted from remains of the fallen. Fed and strengthened by the blood that has been spilled, it rapidly spreads - turning man into monster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the people bleed - paralyzed by war - they have turned to you and your kin, the Writhens. Being the only ones willing, you've been tasked to venture forth and eradicate the all-consuming Blight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/931c03d14e439e58645604af7a0e68ff.poster.avif?t=1744224268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/931c03d14e439e58645604af7a0e68ff.webm?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1774880/extras/931c03d14e439e58645604af7a0e68ff.mp4?t=1744224268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a fresh take on Action-Horror games which mixes a deep Visceral combat with mechanics inspired from rogue-lites and extraction games, offering a unique and thrilling gameplay experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight with up to three friends against both humans and monsters in a visceral co-op action experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your decision-making skills to the test. Will you go back and secure your spoils or risk it all and push forward? How far are you willing to go? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an engaging directional combat system that is accessible to newcomers but offers a high skill ceiling for more seasoned players. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a diverse range of weapons, armor, talents and customize them to best suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a beautifully decaying medieval world filled with secrets and hidden treasures waiting to be discovered. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Blight: Survival is a PvE Action-Horror Game set in a brutal medieval world. Play in solo or team-up with up to 3 friends as you face monsters and men in a tense battle for survival. How far are you willing to go?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Portuguese - Portugal, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
